# Apple Essential Direct
# Focused on Apple infrastructure that should stay DIRECT in mainland China:
# device setup, time sync, Apple Account, APNs, iCloud / CloudKit, App Store,
# software updates and certificate validation.
# Primary reference: Apple support article 101555 (enterprise network hosts/ports).
# Deliberately does NOT use DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple.com, so region-sensitive Apple
# content services can still follow the ordinary overseas policy.

# Device setup / activation / captive portal
DOMAIN,albert.apple.com
DOMAIN,captive.apple.com
DOMAIN,gs.apple.com
DOMAIN,humb.apple.com
DOMAIN,static.ips.apple.com
DOMAIN,sq-device.apple.com
DOMAIN,tbsc.apple.com

# Time sync (UDP 123)
DOMAIN,time-ios.apple.com
DOMAIN,time.apple.com
DOMAIN,time-macos.apple.com

# Apple Push / device management
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,push.apple.com
DOMAIN,deviceenrollment.apple.com
DOMAIN,deviceservices-external.apple.com
DOMAIN,gdmf.apple.com

